  "description": "The legend of Korean boy idols recognized by everyone, 'car operation'! There is only one secret to perfect operation, including singing ability, acting skills, choreography skills, sense of entertainment, and private life. When I was in school, I was a gloomy and non-existent student weighing 105 kilograms. He was the operator of a fan cafe for \"Jushinhye,\" an idol at the time. \"Operator...\" Who is he? You're middle-aged, aren't you? \" “At least it’s a child. You have a great tone~\" Due to the serious and calm nature of the operation, the members of the fan cafe misunderstand him as middle-aged... Thanks to this, the identity of idols is being thoroughly hidden! Meanwhile, the partner 'Jung Ye-seul', whom I met on a virtual marriage entertainment program, begins to like the operation of a virtual husband with a unique atmosphere... \"The position of a good man and a good woman in the entertainment industry, I can eat it for you.\" Cha Un-young's first love and eternal idol 'Ju Shin-hye', Unpredictable ploys are full of girlfriends! Attractive supermodel 'Ju Ye-seul'. Who will Cha Un-yong love at the end? The entertainment and love story of \"Operation,\" the best idol and operator of a fan cafe.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/57672662), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%9A%B4%EC%98%81%EC%9E%90%EC%9D%98-%EA%B6%8C%ED%95%9C%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C/4138)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/122645)",
